- Baik.

110
00:05:48,557 --> 00:05:50,809
- Aku napas, kau denyut.
- Ya.

111
00:05:53,061 --> 00:05:55,104
- Astaga.
- Mencoba dorong rahang.

112
00:05:55,105 --> 00:05:56,897
- Denyut lemah dan lambat.
- Namanya?

113
00:05:56,898 --> 00:05:59,191
- Ayahku. Oliver.
- Hei, Oliver.

114
00:05:59,192 --> 00:06:00,819
Bisa tolong buka matamu?

115
00:06:01,903 --> 00:06:02,821
Ya. Sebentar.

116
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,743
Baiklah. Satu, dua, tiga.

117
00:06:10,954 --> 00:06:12,788
Gangguan pernapasan berat.

118
00:06:12,789 --> 00:06:16,041
Kegagalan dialisis, mungkin
gagal ginjal dan kelebihan cairan.

119
00:06:16,042 --> 00:06:17,669
Siapkan BiPAP untuk pernapasan.

120
