- Kapan dialisis terakhir?
- Seharusnya kemarin pagi.

121
00:06:21,089 --> 00:06:22,549
Infus nitro segera.

122
00:06:23,925 --> 00:06:24,926
- Kau bisa?
- Ya.

123
00:06:25,802 --> 00:06:27,219
Dia yang menyerang Emma?

124
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:28,429
- Akan lakukan CT?
- Ya.

125
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:30,014
Emma butuh diperiksa.

126
00:06:30,015 --> 00:06:32,850
Cassie, bisa periksa Emma?

127
00:06:32,851 --> 00:06:34,184
Laporan korban kekerasan.

128
00:06:34,185 --> 00:06:35,686
- Sungguh?
- Aku tak apa.

129
00:06:35,687 --> 00:06:37,730
- Dia mencekikmu.
- Hanya kepala.

130
00:06:37,731 --> 00:06:39,565
