Periksa total di Selatan 18

131
00:06:39,566 --> 00:06:41,692
kalau perlu
beri pernyataan ke polisi.

132
00:06:41,693 --> 00:06:42,986
Haruskah?

133
00:06:44,195 --> 00:06:46,071
- Ya.
- Tentu saja.

134
00:06:46,072 --> 00:06:47,114
Jangan khawatir.

135
00:06:47,115 --> 00:06:49,533
- Aku akan menemani.
- Kucarikan tempat.

136
00:06:49,534 --> 00:06:51,912
- Pasienmu serobot CT pasienku.
- Kini dia pasienku?

137
00:06:52,037 --> 00:06:54,788
Dia menunggu lama.
Aku tak akan keluar dari sini.

138
00:06:54,789 --> 00:06:55,998
Masa bodoh.

139
00:06:55,999 --> 00:06:59,960
Kau harus peduli
karena jika kau buat dia cedera parah

140
00:06:59,961 --> 00:07:02,838
