BiPAP mulai pada 10 dan 5.

155
00:07:49,636 --> 00:07:52,429
Jantung bagus, napas bagus.
Ada banyak cairan.

156
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:53,681
Edema pulmonari.

157
00:07:53,682 --> 00:07:55,809
Perawatan terbaiknya, dr. Javadi?

158
00:07:56,476 --> 00:07:57,769
- Nitrat.
- Dosisnya?

159
00:08:00,563 --> 00:08:03,774
TD 198 dan 132. Denyut 120.

160
00:08:03,775 --> 00:08:05,234
Saturasi hanya 85.

161
00:08:05,235 --> 00:08:07,820
TD bagus. Berikan 400 mcg
per menit selama 2-5 menit.

162
00:08:07,821 --> 00:08:08,947
Aku tanya dr. Javadi.

163
00:08:09,948 --> 00:08:12,116
Bukan nitrat rendah,
lalu naikkan bertahap?

164
00:08:12,117 --> 00:08:14,243
Pada edema pulmonari,
lakukan sebaliknya.

165
00:08:14,244 --> 00:08:16,246
Dia butuh dialisis
untuk membuang cairan.

166
00:08:17,706 --> 00:08:20,082
- Jadwal dialisisnya?
- Senin, Rabu, Jumat.

167
00:08:20,083 --> 00:08:21,543
Kemarin absen karena pernikahan.

168
00:08:22,293 --> 00:08:24,753
Kami ke klinik tadi pagi.
Biasanya buka hari Sabtu,

169
00:08:24,754 --> 00:08:26,046
tapi tutup karena 4 Juli.

170
00:08:26,047 --> 00:08:27,923
