- Brookville.

171
00:08:27,924 --> 00:08:29,091
Jaraknya 1,5 jam.

172
00:08:29,092 --> 00:08:31,635
Ya, Bu. Kucoba
ke RS Pine Ridge di Ford City,

173
00:08:31,636 --> 00:08:34,180
